# Markup fragments, and the document assembled from them.
#
# Prettier does not merely reformat an unbalanced fragment, it repairs one:
# given a partial whose closing tags live in the next partial, it helpfully
# adds them, and the assembled document then carries both sets. That was not a
# theory — it happened on the first run and produced a page with seven spurious
# closing tags. There is no configuration for "reformat but do not balance", so
# these are hand-formatted, and index.html is generated from them.
apps/chat/renderer/partials/
